(* Endoplasmic Reticulum \(ER\): Rough ER is studded with membrane-bound ribosomes) Tj
T*
(synthesizing secretome, transmembrane, and lysosomal proteins. Nascent polypeptides) Tj
T*
(bear an N-terminal hydrophobic Signal Peptide recognized by the Signal Recognition) Tj
T*
(Particle \(SRP\). SRP arrests translation, binds the ER membrane SRP receptor, and) Tj
T*
(transfers the ribosome-nascent chain complex to the Sec61 translocon channel for) Tj
T*
(co-translational translocation into the ER lumen.) Tj
T*
(* Protein Folding and N-Glycosylation: Molecular chaperones \(BiP/GRP78, calnexin,) Tj
