(calreticulin\) ensure proper folding. Protein disulfide isomerase \(PDI\) catalyzes) Tj
T*
(disulfide bond formation. Oligosaccharyltransferase transfers a preformed 14-sugar) Tj
T*
(oligosaccharide \(Glc3Man9GlcNAc2\) en bloc to recipient asparagine residues in the) Tj
T*
(consensus sequence Asn-X-Ser/Thr. Misfolded proteins undergo ER-Associated) Tj
T*
(Degradation \(ERAD\) via retrotranslocation to the cytosol and polyubiquitination for) Tj
T*
(proteasomal destruction.) Tj
T*
(* Golgi Complex: Polarized organelle composed of cis, medial, and trans-Golgi) Tj
T*
(cisternal stacks. Receives vesicles at the cis-Golgi network, modifies) Tj
T*
(oligosaccharide chains \(mannose trimming, addition of GlcNAc, galactose, sialic) Tj
T*
(acid\), and packages sorted cargoes at the trans-Golgi network \(TGN\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
